[{"title":"陪桂彦良先生宴董氏荷亭","author":"乌斯道","text":"白头贤传晋阳归，十载风尘故旧稀。\n重会岂非天有待，尽欢宁觉地相违。\n云分野色来池馆，雨挟花香到客衣。\n处士要题诗满壁，金盘甘露博珠玑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36923,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澹然斋诗为泽上人赋","author":"乌斯道","text":"太白归来万事慵，帘垂云影石房空。\n虚名远付飞鸿外，胜地冥观落照中。\n浮蚁杯从何处绿，来禽花自及春红。\n军持独有曹溪水，千载馀甘与蜜同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36924,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张丞书来许舟相迎舟竟不至戏答","author":"乌斯道","text":"玉人空寄锦云笺，目断蛟门动隔年。\n昔日移山曾泣鬼，如今缩地却惭仙。\n云随鱼鸟江天阔，春到莺花野日妍。\n渡口柳条应见笑，夕阳长有落潮船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36925,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢李弘道寄灵寿杖","author":"乌斯道","text":"寄来仙杖费追寻，满谷云霞太华深。\n元气百年搏紫玉，故情千里重黄金。\n关河迢递悬愁眼，宫阙森严负素心。\n敢望孔光沾宠锡，且须扶老旧园林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36926,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东湖","author":"乌斯道","text":"东湖天阔岸萦回，一曲中间有镜开。\n渔艇每从山后出，佛灯多落水中来。\n凌寒身在清虚府，访古人行紫翠堆。\n鲍益庙前情不尽，白沙青石荫苍苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36927,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二灵山","author":"乌斯道","text":"东湖阔处二灵山，龙吐双珠落水间。\n四面乱峰云气白，半天孤塔土花斑。\n当年驯虎归何处，今日轻鸥只自閒。\n问讯老僧诗句好，清风谡谡满松关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36928,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悟空寺","author":"乌斯道","text":"层楼杰阁护慈云，暮鼓晨钟咫尺闻。\n峰削芙蓉天际好，径随薝卜涧边分。\n清风玉佩来仙侣，静夜篝灯检律文。\n大海一沤吾未解，何当从此谢尘氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36929,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"育王寺 其一","author":"乌斯道","text":"鄮岭名如鹫岭传，刹竿无恙已千年。\n地雄南土居三佛，山尽东溟倚半天。\n宸翰香浮高阁表，岩泉清出老松前。\n游人自觉虚生白，犹觅神光上客船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36930,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"育王寺 其二","author":"乌斯道","text":"灵踪深閟压东南，楼阁丹青闪翠岚。\n灯影半空摇上塔，炉薰千载出西庵。\n山看玉几无云好，泉取金沙瀹茗甘。\n细读长公碑刻画，黄昏万丈觅龙潭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36931,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游狮子山龙潭","author":"乌斯道","text":"万壑千峰竞斗奇，穷探愁见夕阳低。\n乾坤自是开图画，今古谁能尽品题。\n风搅飞泉晴亦雨，云封洞口到犹迷。\n更怜胜地多神贶，却恨仙人不共栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36932,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尝桔徐子实家","author":"乌斯道","text":"竹下围棋送夕阳，野云飞尽水风凉。\n已收残局看花饮，更唤佳儿剪桔尝。\n蒂湿尚含清晓露，味甘何待满林霜。\n谁知又食家山果，旧岁兹辰在异乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36933,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城南","author":"乌斯道","text":"城南风景旧时闻，近日长来倚夕曛。\n断碣有诗王相国，古祠无主董徵君。\n野桥一望皆春水，老树千年独暮云。\n咄咄与谁论往事，白头村叟自耕耘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36934,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相山偶作","author":"乌斯道","text":"青山四绕出无门，半日从容坐竹根。\n目送溪流入东海，心随秋日照中原。\n石头绕路如人立，藤蔓和云落地繁。\n便合买牛耕谷口，人间何处是桃源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36935,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天镜亭","author":"乌斯道","text":"亭中危坐月轮孤，何必西游贺监湖。\n白水摇光千顷阔，青天倒影一尘无。\n鱼龙不敢生风浪，鸥鹭何须伴钓徒。\n当日胡公深纳事，此中端不许陶朱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36936,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登蒋山","author":"乌斯道","text":"作镇皇州势独雄，英英紫气散晴峰。\n龙蟠实为金陵重，鹤怨曾因蕙帐空。\n云拥禅关新建塔，花明潜邸旧行宫。\n试凌绝顶閒凭眺，锦绣山河感慨中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36937,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄乡中诸友","author":"乌斯道","text":"五十馀年物外身，一官谁料负清贫。\n受金遭谤空惭我，全璧归来有几人。\n凫驿云间明月晓，鹿山风静野花春。\n诸公足遂家乡乐，耕钓终须作隐沦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36938,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题海角石","author":"乌斯道","text":"石起孤峰指北堂，娟娟玉笋半寻强。\n气涵海底千年润，地引山根一脉长。\n昔日谁留清玩在，閒云自益小亭凉。\n一从开辟高多少，直欲从容问五羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36939,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游宝峰庵和僧穆庵韵","author":"乌斯道","text":"乱山窝里缚禅庵，路转东溪渐向南。\n林鸟每留閒客住，野猿时对老僧谈。\n庖分夜雨岩前溜，阁贮秋云坞内岚。\n谁把新诗题瘦竹，一枝摇动翠?毵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36940,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谭节妇","author":"乌斯道","text":"城破兵连远近村，皇皇趋入泮宫门。\n甘从烈士捐生义，不学降臣负主恩。\n气逐彩云随剑化，形摹青血与砖存。\n我来感悼前朝事，为立穹碑慰古魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36941,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吊钱融堂先生","author":"乌斯道","text":"哭罢麒麟几度秋，何人重赋我心忧。\n词章谩似机中锦，身世空如水上沤。\n今日修文应帝召，淳风接武独严州。\n昔人曾挹慈湖水，倾泻桐江浩荡流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36942,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阚峰","author":"乌斯道","text":"春山花发雨霏霏，花雨曾沾阚相衣。\n今日山花依旧好，东风吹雨湿僧扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36943,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居二绝 其一","author":"乌斯道","text":"大儿田头车未歇，小儿牵犊已归来。\n茅堂正对佳山水，种秫多令办酒材。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居二绝 其二","author":"乌斯道","text":"属玉群飞水下滩，松杉荫合草堂閒。\n苍头扫径非因客，自爱从容出看山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题钓图","author":"乌斯道","text":"我欲沧江把钓竿，含沙拍塞可心寒。\n此中端是谁家子，秋水孤舟坐得安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36946,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"棣华亭为泰和萧鹏举赋 其一","author":"乌斯道","text":"玉片英英着淡黄，独怜红萼为同芳。\n东风不敢枝头急，燕子飞来日正长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36947,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"棣华亭为泰和萧鹏举赋 其二","author":"乌斯道","text":"昨夜薰风放好花，朱帘碧槛玉人家。\n世间炎热难开眼，且向中宵挹露华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36948,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"棣华亭为泰和萧鹏举赋 其三","author":"乌斯道","text":"深深亭院雁来初，华萼联辉锦不如。\n见说玉皇新下令，清霜不许到前除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36949,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"棣华亭为泰和萧鹏举赋 其四","author":"乌斯道","text":"花迟花早自相依，积雪初融日影微。\n徽轸有诗听未彻，鹡鸰枝上一双飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36950,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画三首 其一","author":"乌斯道","text":"江水江蒲随路转，山云山树逐人来。\n青春不负骑驴客，恰待鸟啼花乱开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36951,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画三首 其二","author":"乌斯道","text":"水气腾腾浮草阁，山光冉冉落楸枰。\n不知此地谁为主，招得幽人有胜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36952,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画三首 其三","author":"乌斯道","text":"白云滚滚扶山起，碧藓离离着地匀。\n赴陇鹤书天外远，草庐空老读书人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36953,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈省之之永嘉二首 其一","author":"乌斯道","text":"几度寻师叩竹扉，等閒却立见天机。\n春山杳杳浮云出，湖水涓涓白鸟飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36954,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈省之之永嘉二首 其二","author":"乌斯道","text":"西堂今过几春风，须为慇勤问谢公。\n乌氏斋中春草碧，梦中幽趣得相同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36955,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨梅","author":"乌斯道","text":"松斋不写玉纤纤，瘦影依稀隔翠帘。\n越女漫誇天下白，我心偏喜邑中黔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36956,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题兰","author":"乌斯道","text":"血涴中原草不芳，幽花山上独飘香。\n倚风一笑青春过，只把深心答太阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36957,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","