。\n翠羽飞来休啄破，未曾供奉赤瑛盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36970,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"睡禽","author":"乌斯道","text":"昨夜春风不作寒，幽禽飞下碧琅玕。\n只应此地无缯缴，不独身安梦亦安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36971,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳桥","author":"乌斯道","text":"柳枝撩乱春风急，燕子低回晓雨晴。\n步屧不须琴与鹤，可中泉石有馀清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36972,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其一","author":"乌斯道","text":"龙母山前曙色微，故人相别思依依。\n五羊仙子知何处，一片征帆带雨飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36973,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其二","author":"乌斯道","text":"雨歇北风生晓寒，湍流初急进船难。\n路从螺蚌湾头过，羡杀轻鸥卧石滩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36974,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其三","author":"乌斯道","text":"两山不见临溪屋，长日还无唤渡人。\n逆水孤舟行数日，哀猿空使泪沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36975,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其四","author":"乌斯道","text":"乱石排溪急水悬，夕阳衰草白鸥边。\n明朝短策穿云去，不似舟中得稳眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36976,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其五","author":"乌斯道","text":"廿里徒行万里遥，难于孤艇逆春潮。\n自从羸马归官后，便合还山作老樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36977,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其六","author":"乌斯道","text":"直上龙威万石梯，翠萝遮日白云低。\n须臾又作沙鸥伴，筏上吟诗下浅溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36978,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其七","author":"乌斯道","text":"磷磷湍濑雪兼风，短筏蛇行乱石中。\n今夜好从何处宿，笑将蛮语问山翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36979,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其八","author":"乌斯道","text":"中天晴日敛山霏，犹有高林露滴衣。\n欲就石崖题岁月，湍流催筏去如飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36980,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其九","author":"乌斯道","text":"出水云山几百重，回流犹是学蟠龙。\n绿溪贳酒无村舍，终日娱人只老松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36981,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其十","author":"乌斯道","text":"道出容州蚤泊船，可人相见玉娟娟。\n隔溪咫尺神仙窟，不得幽探小洞天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36982,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其十一","author":"乌斯道","text":"水天空阔两山齐，茅屋参差竹树低。\n千里客怀谁为写，一声春鸟隔林啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36983,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其十二","author":"乌斯道","text":"舟到崧台是岁除，乡人一见胜家书。\n绸缪已?三更醉，又复联床话故庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36984,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其十三","author":"乌斯道","text":"青天阔处是藤州，遗迹空寻秦少游。\n树压古城人影寂，夜深江月下高楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36985,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其十四","author":"乌斯道","text":"舟泊苍梧挹渚风，九疑何处吊重瞳。\n两溪流水浮云底，四面青山夕照中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36986,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其十五","author":"乌斯道","text":"为爱嘉鱼不放舟，从容访古入林丘。\n回仙不见空祠宇，白发黄尘起暮愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36987,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅腊月十日自石龙赴广州会城途中纪行 其十六","author":"乌斯道","text":"渚清沙白野云宽，一棹随风下石湍。\n客里逢春须尽醉，只无生菜试春盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36988,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题江山枯木","author":"乌斯道","text":"长江水落见龙亭，老树风高堕鹤翎。\n故里好山归梦远，春来空有蕨芽青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36989,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅花三首 其一","author":"乌斯道","text":"繁花枝上蝶成堆，尽日春风解不开。\n正把贞心倾晓月，角声休度石溪来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36990,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅花三首 其二","author":"乌斯道","text":"道上轻埃逐锦鞯，山中孤洁似神仙。\n多情最是清泠水，照见冰容似去年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36991,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅花三首 其三","author":"乌斯道","text":"笑颜如玉为谁开，绿发仙人倚石台。\n昨夜雪晴天似水，直教明月为徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36992,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题慈湖书院壁","author":"乌斯道","text":"法坐千年有哲人，考钟伐鼓荐蘩蘋。\n腾腾车骑门前过，谁识慈湖二月春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36993,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乞休","author":"乌斯道","text":"蚤年骑马听朝班，头白还乡看旧山。\n涧水松风应笑我，老来方得片时閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36994,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]